  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the cowboy stereotype",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the man (cowboy) and the textual material 'it's the cowboy way of doin things', which together construct the cowboy stereotype. The meme implicitly invites the user to identify with or adopt the persona of the cowboy, associating the user with the projected traits of ruggedness, aggression, and the romanticized 'cowboy way' of handling situations, even if it involves violence or gun use. There are no explicit deictics like 'me' or 'you', but the projection is implicit through identification with the visual and textual stereotype.",
